<title>USA: D&amp;P says reaffirms Sierra Health &amp; Life.</title>
<headline>D&amp;P says reaffirms Sierra Health &amp; Life.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Wednesday it reaffirmed the Single A claims-paying ability rating of Sierra Health &amp; Life Insurance Co and removed the rating from watch-developing.</p>
<p>It said the actions follow the recent announcement by the company's parent, Sierra Health Services Inc, that it terminated an agreement to merge with  Physicians Corp of America.</p>
<p>The merger was terminated because the two parties could not agree to revised terms for the transaction, Duff &amp; Phelps said.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
